# STL cylinder demo with opt-in Bouzidi LI-BB walls (M-GEO-3a).
# The stl(file=...) path is relative to the repo root.

Simulation mgeo3a_stl_cylinder_libb D2Q9

Define U = 0.03
Define H = 1.0
Define cx = 1.0
Define cy = 0.5
Define R = 0.2
Define Re = 0.24

Domain L = 4.0 x 1.0  N = 80 x 20
Physics nu = 0.05

Obstacle cyl stl(file = "examples/geometry_stl/cylinder.stl", scale = 1.0, translate = [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], z_slice = 0.5, wall = libb)

Boundary west  velocity(ux = 4*U*y*(H - y)/H^2, uy = 0)
Boundary east  pressure(rho = 1.0)
Boundary south wall
Boundary north wall

Run 50 steps
Output vtk every 50 [rho, ux, uy]
